@namespace PoPunkouterSoftware.Client

@* The build stamp, vYYMMDD, pinned to the lower-right corner of every page: the estate's
   .po-version (po-tokens.css). YYMMDD is the UTC date of the HEAD commit, computed once by
   PoBuildStamp in Directory.Build.props and read through Services/Ui/BuildStamp.cs, so this
   stamp (server-rendered) and /diag (WASM) show the same value. On a phone it rides above the
   bottom nav (--po-stamp-lift, BottomNav.razor.css). Click-through, so it never covers a tap. *@
<footer class="app-build-version" aria-label="Application build version">
    <span class="po-version" title="Build @BuildStamp.Value">v@(BuildStamp.Value)</span>
</footer>
